$[Import* std]
With `else`, the other clauses must still name alternatives of the variant.
$[# Shape [% {Variant {' {Field "circle" Float} {Field "dot" Unit}}}]]
${!case {: {#dot unit} Shape} {square s 1} {else 0}}
expect-error: type: handler `square` matches no alternative of `<circle: Float, dot: Unit>`
